<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-17T05:09:33.978Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 05:09:33 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;A Punjab woman linked to a Pakistan-based handler carried out a railway-track blast in Rajasthan, killing two people and prompting the arrest of two suspects with alleged Pakistani handler ties. In Afghanistan, an unexploded ordnance blast in Ghazni killed one child and injured another, while fruit exports to Iran face delays of up to a month and Iran and Afghanistan have agreed to expand border crossings. India opened the Wagah crossing for Pakistani Sikh pilgrims, and a tanker was attacked in the Strait of Hormuz off Oman. The conflict recorded 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQbTl5RWVWNzJOd1BBVC1RZmR6aHBLUFZTaEtvZkFYVEtzV2N4c01TS05Oek15M2U2NS1lZk5MQkI4QU8zSm9va1JlU213c0dwS3doMXJ6N1RSZVA3OWUzbVI3Vk16MGtobTRKVTNQRFJrMTRvQVlNTzFRY2Z3dG82MWRGb21pNjF0djB0VjFGVVplRE9IRVNoY2ZtQjVkRkk?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi-_?oc=5&quot;&gt;Moneycontrol.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxQUHhBMXpJN0k1VlBvMDJ3RVFrVk1jN2EwNjNPUERsb08tdGVDaEYwR2xYREdvWmpnR3VTSXFxX0kybm84SXlEOVNnQ2pKbmtzemNjTE9rMWVjcWlxZGtoMzdpNUt4Z192NGliZ0E4anMteTJULVNqTjJhUFRJb3dVb1Zma00wT3M5eGNVb2h3?oc=5&quot;&gt;8AM Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;IFPRI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxQQzh3UlByb3U1OEx3R1JKVUhOZ0pUOFIwUi1DTW8zSnA2LThXbFVhdnZmbEhOUUVhbzA5Tm85OUEtYkN1MGQxc1VUbkt1TkdJV0JKY2FxRkRPbDVlQ3ZiT1pQdmhFZU1VMGdncS02R09QYXowMWU5ZTB0Q3N1U0V5T0VJLWl2a1FkcjVwNjV4djZzOXdSYzl1T0wxNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;UrduPoint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a hr